<title>POLAND: Agros to raise stake in subsidiary - PAP.</title>
<headline>Agros to raise stake in subsidiary - PAP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food trader and producer Agros Holding SA will increase its stake in its subsidiary Agros-Lowicz to 62.6 percent from 55 percent, PAP news agency reported.</p>
<p>It quoted Agros-Lowicz's president Stanislaw Bar as saying that the general shareholders meeting voted on Tuesday to increase the firm's capital by 15.3 million zlotys to 51 million zlotys by issuing new shares for Agros.</p>
<p>The treasury's stake in Agros will fall to 37 percent from the current 44.6 percent after the issue.</p>
<p>((-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700))</p>
